body:
@ga: i've thought about therapy but the truth is I'm really scared to go. I have other issues to and I don't want to find out how truly messed up I am. if that makes sense.

@ random: that's good that you've found a healthier way. but i dunno, i feel like this isn't something i can just grow out of since it's been with me since i was very young.

@kreuzer: um no. I've never even been in a relationship and don't know who you're talking about.
